  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nThe expression = ([120×120×120-100×100×100])/([120×120+120×100+100×100])\n\n**Formula used:**\n\na³ - b³ = (a - b) × (a² + ab + b²)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nAccording to the question\n\n⇒ ([120×120×120-100×100×100])/([120×120+120×100+100×100])\n\n⇒ ([120³-100³])/([120²+120×100+100²])\n\n⇒ ([120-100] times [120²+120×100+100²] )/([120²+120×100+100²])\n\n⇒ 120 -100 = 20\n\n**∴ The required result will be 20. **\n\n138:T528,",
